---
args:{request:GrantCycleRequest;candidateActivity:EvidencePage;links:EvidencePage[]}
returns:SharedActivityDecision
---
For this activity, trace each grant-funded share to its own eligible award condition, distinct supported cost amount and allocation period. Compare outcome attribution across grants so one delivered service is not reported twice as separate full benefits. Keep unsupported shares withheld while preserving supported shares that have an independent basis. Return exact source references and identify the missing allocation or outcome evidence.
